items.description:
npm i @asif-sirajudeen/eds-ui (peer tailwindcss ^4.3). Add to app CSS in this order: tailwindcss, then themes/default.css, then styles.css:
@import "tailwindcss";
@import "@asif-sirajudeen/eds-ui/themes/default.css";
@import "@asif-sirajudeen/eds-ui/styles.css";
Read component source with the CLI: npx eds-ui list|search|view <x>. Do not shadcn add from @eds-ui.
